## Rules

- One row per issue per target entity.
- When an issue is opened, set `status: open` and a date. When it's picked up in the target entity's own engagement, mark `status: picked-up` with the date and link to the follow-up plan.
- Never silently fix cross-entity issues from another entity's work. Doing so loses audit trail and mixes scopes.

